gram\n<MATH_0024>\nwith <MATH_0025> can be completed to a commutative dotted square with\n<MATH_0026>.\n<ITEMOPEN_0006>RMS3<ITEMCLOSE_0006> For every pair of morphisms <MATH_0027> and\n<MATH_0028> with source <MATH_0029> such that <MATH_0030>\nthere exists a <MATH_0031> with target <MATH_0032> such that\n<MATH_0033>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nA set of arrows <MATH_0034> of <MATH_0035> is called a <TEXTITOPEN_0003>multiplicative system<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>\nif it is both a left multiplicative system and a right multiplicative system.\nIn other words, this means that MS1, MS2, MS3 hold, where\nMS1 <MATH_0036> LMS1 <MATH_0037> RMS1, MS2 <MATH_0038> LMS2 <MATH_0039> RMS2, and\nMS3 <MATH_0040> LMS3 <MATH_0041> RMS3. (That said, of course LMS1 <MATH_0042> RMS1\n<MATH_0043> MS1.)\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aa501b163338449061afcd718feb2e482e8e5824bdb0b38c1c3b562b5f6e2bdc", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:04VC:definition/0001"}, "state": "READY"}}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:8183881d1da2d854ef34daa5b99758b2abcb01ad2ab83a0e27ba142e8cee221f", "path": "docs/evidence/categories-completion-p006-raw.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:b9fdf6505ed9a5a2a2c213c64fff874c2289c3436d8106028050e948e7d48eaa"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:b33b9b37f1623d49d4030a11f1661dfc29fa2ce4", "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "read_context": {"citations": [], "neighbors": [{"context_id": "inventory:categories:04VB:section_title/0001", "relation": "before"}, {"context_id": "inventory:categories:04VC:definition/0001", "relation": "after"}], "references": [], "unit_id": "tag:04VB:prose-0001"}, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_required_terms": {"catalog_hash": "sha256:899a668e50f3487b37dd8781e9b5a88e3e16d272ad91b4078ac6b9d847935c12", "occurrences": [{"concept": "category", "projection_end": 64, "projection_start": 56, "rule": "catalog", "source_term": "category"}, {"concept": "set", "projection_end": 86, "projection_start": 83, "rule": "catal